  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
